# ============================================================
# Java 服务镜像构建上下文清单（Dockerfile context=./services/java）
# 目标：阻断 target/（≈55MB 编译产物）与 IDE/密钥文件进 build context
# 纪律：与 .gitignore 同步维护；build 阶段仅需 pom.xml + src
# ============================================================

# --- 编译产物 ---
target/

# --- IDE / 系统 ---
.git/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# --- 密钥与环境 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- 与本镜像无关 ---
*.log
*.md
README.md
